Shouldn't we also export `Block` from `Packet`? You're already using it here:
https://github.com/mermaid-js/mermaid/blob/136f1c50e725b6303c1f0bebec828be0e604ed97/packages/mermaid/src/diagrams/packet/types.ts#L6

If you want to exclude `AstNode` attributes then you should this type:

```typescript
// inside packages/parser/src/index.ts
/**
 * Exclude/omit all `AstNode` attributes recursively.
 */
export type RecursiveAstOmit<T> = T extends object
  ? { [P in keyof T as Exclude<P, keyof AstNode>]: RecursiveAstOmit<T[P]> }
  : T;
```

```typescript
// inside packages/mermaid/src/diagrams/packet/types.ts
import type { PacketBlock, RecursiveAstOmit } from 'mermaid-parser';

// the name doesn't matter here since it's for the diagram
export type Block = RecursiveAstOmit<PacketBlock>;
```

